# Who must review changes to which files. Branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners") makes this binding.
#
# 1LoD = the team that builds the agent. 2LoD = independent risk / compliance (CCOR).
# This file defaults every owner to the repository owner so it works for a single-person demo. In that case the
# separation of duties is simulated. For a real two-person split, replace the 2LoD lines below with a second
# GitHub account or team, e.g.  @your-org/ccor-2lod  (the 2LoD must not be able to approve their own build, and
# the builder must not be a member of the 2LoD team).

